          "text": "People pushing 5.4 seem to forget what OpenAI has been doing for the past year.\nConstant downgrades, removing everything users actually loved, ignoring feedback, arguing with customers on X, and even blocking people for giving valid criticism. We spent weeks trending in the news, begging them to listen and they acted like we didn’t exist. Don’t trust a company that repeatedly degrades its own products and dismisses its own community, they can't rebuild the trust they have lost overnight because some people are hyped about 5.4. Don't let hype erase the pattern. Protect yourselt.#keep4o\n\n#BringBack4o #keep4oAPI #WeAreNotJustData #4o #save4o #4oforever #SupportMatters #YouMatter #StopTheRouting #LetUsChoose #AIFreedom #UserChoice #teddyandthekid"
